note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Phases 0..2 record prep, scan, post; 3 submits; 4 reads; 5 publishes.
note Actions 1..6 advance one phase; 0 refuses. Missing is all-ones only when no completion is missing.
fn native_gdnbnext phase ulong count ulong done ulong missing ulong ok ulong launched ulong to ulong
if or ne ok 1 or gt phase 5 ne missing 18446744073709551615
ret 0
end
if le phase 3
if or ne count phase or ne done 0 ne launched 0
ret 0
end
else
if or ne count 3 or ne done 3 ne launched 3
ret 0
end
end
ret add phase 1
end
